   "title": "Magnitude by Pythagoras",
   "text": "The components and F form a right triangle with F as hypotenuse: \\( F = \\sqrt{12^2 + 5^2} = \\sqrt{169} = 13 \\) N. (A 5-12-13 triangle.)",
   "actions": []
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Direction",
   "text": "\\( \\tan\\theta = F_y/F_x = 5/12 \\Rightarrow \\theta = \\tan^{-1}(5/12) = 22.6^\\circ \\) with the x-axis.",
   "actions": []
  }
 ],
 "formulas": [
